---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Infrastructure | Steve Weiler"
  description="Enterprise systems, virtualization, networking, monitoring, and infrastructure automation experience from Steve Weiler."
>
  <main>
    <section class="page-header">
      <h1>Infrastructure</h1>
      <p>
        More than 25 years of experience supporting the systems, networks, and
        operational tooling that keep organizations running.
      </p>
    </section>

    <article class="card project-card">
      <div class="project-header">
        <div class="project-badge">IO</div>
        <div>
          <h2>Infrastructure operations</h2>
          <p class="project-kicker">Reliable systems from server to service</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-visual project-visual--infra infrastructure-visual">
        <img
          class="project-visual-image project-visual-image--contain"
          src="/images/infrastructure-admin-graphic.png"
          alt="Servers connected to a router, switch, firewall, and monitoring dashboard"
        >
      </div>

      <p>
        Hands-on administration across Windows and Linux environments, combining
        day-to-day support with long-term planning, systems integration, and
        practical automation.
      </p>
    </article>

    <section class="cards" aria-label="Infrastructure capabilities">
      <article class="card project-card">
        <div class="project-header">
          <div class="project-badge">SE</div>
          <div>
            <h2>Systems engineering</h2>
            <p class="project-kicker">Windows and Linux</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>
          Administration and support for enterprise server environments, identity,
          access, core services, and business-critical applications.
        </p>

        <p><strong>Technologies:</strong> Windows Server, Linux, Active Directory</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card project-card">
        <div class="project-header">
          <div class="project-badge">VN</div>
          <div>
            <h2>Virtualization &amp; networking</h2>
            <p class="project-kicker">Platforms and connectivity</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>
          Virtual infrastructure and network operations focused on stable services,
          clear dependencies, and dependable access for users and applications.
          Deployed, configured, and supported Dell and HPE servers and Dell, HPE, Cisco, and Meraki network infrastructure.
        </p>

        <p><strong>Technologies:</strong> VMware, TCP/IP, routing, switching</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card project-card">
        <div class="project-header">
          <div class="project-badge">MA</div>
          <div>
            <h2>Monitoring &amp; automation</h2>
            <p class="project-kicker">Visibility and repeatability</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>
          Monitoring, diagnostics, and automation that make infrastructure easier
          to understand, maintain, and support through operational change.
        </p>

        <p><strong>Technologies:</strong> OpenNMS, scripting, systems integration</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="card cta-strip">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Infrastructure experience</p>
        <h2>Built around reliability, clarity, and practical support.</h2>
        <p>
          See the full work history and certifications, or get in touch to discuss
          infrastructure and systems engineering.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="/resume/">View Resume</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/contact/">Contact Me</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .infrastructure-visual {
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
    min-height: 0;
  }
</style>
